hale-lang/voice @ aaa3d39d238cbe37d800f67c8a57a07ac677200c (main, the
merge of voice#29, the habitat attach: voice as a habitat-scoped heart,
its needs memory, nerves, database and broker, its database's migration
handed to the habitat as `api migrate`, and a partial handover refused
at start)

The tree beside this file is that commit's (`git archive`), vendored for
dna/tests/first_run_test.hl (GH #1653) and never fetched at test time,
less its scripts/ and .github/, which neither its programs nor its
documents (which the graft reads) name, and less the `.gitignore`
rules that hide a compiled binary (`/api`, `/brain`, `/node`, `/store`:
this repository refuses such a rule, and a build writes no binary into the
tree). Moving the pin is re-vendoring the tree at the
new commit and naming it here.
